013000* --- 1000-INITIALISE: INITIALISATION
013100 1000-INITIALISE.
013200     MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(1:8) TO WS-RUN-TS
013300     STRING WS-RUN-TS(1:4) '-' WS-RUN-TS(5:2) '-' WS-RUN-TS(7:2)
013400         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-RUN-DATE
013500     MOVE 'CLRBATCH' TO WS-USER-ID
